     * exact validity [0 .. size - 1]. For size == 0, pass a non-NULL pointer
     * one byte past a 1-byte allocation so any dereference faults immediately.
     * The copy also matters for E-ACSL's initialization checks
     * (-rte-initialized): libFuzzer writes `data` outside instrumented code,
     * so target code must only ever read fuzz_buf, never `data`.
